<h2>Project overview</h2>
<p>This project focuses on the mechanical design and development of a harmonic drive mechanism for robotic applications. The work involves understanding the transmission architecture and its mechanical components.</p>
<h2>Engineering activities</h2>
<ul class="clean-list">
<li>Study of the harmonic drive operating principle and its main components.</li>
<li>Mechanical design and integration considerations for a robotic system.</li>
<li>Evaluation of the mechanism as a compact transmission solution.</li>
</ul>
